WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.730
Chara-su!

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.530
Is everyone Shugo-peppy
again today?

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.060
It's time to start Shugo
Chara Party!

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:11.220
With Pucchi Puchi and Dokki Doki,
it's chock full of anime!

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.530
Sounds fun, right?

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.130
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.320
Unlock!

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:47.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:53.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:57.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:01.140
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:04.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:07.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:14.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:21.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:32.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:35.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:39.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.800
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:54.390
"Playing X Character?"

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:03.400
Hey, Dia... There was a time when
you had an X on you, right?

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:06.100
Yeah... It was just for
a little bit, though.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.130
How did it feel to
have an X on you?

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.610
I think you'd understand if you
put one on yourself, but...

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.470
Maybe it'd be better
to just let it go.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.230
Whoa, it's an X!

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:21.430
If we put this on, maybe we'll
become all dark and evil!

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:23.280
What should we do?
Try putting it on?

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:25.080
Yes! I will put it on!

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.050
Ran, you okay?

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:34.030
She isn't responding.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:36.950
Pass!

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:42.590
It's tiring to move.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:45.160
What's the point of even trying?

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.030
What's happened to our
usual high-tension Ran?

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.500
She's lost all of her will!

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:52.200
Whoa, that was crazy!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.190
X's are scary...

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:57.130
See? So I think it's best
to stop now...

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.240
I'll put it on next!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.840
M-Miki!

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.450
I'm a work of art
myself, aren't I?

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:13.560
So there's no need for me
to create anything more!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:17.040
I-I don't really get it, but the power
of the X is frightful indeed!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.960
I will put it on next!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.920
Have some of Su's <i>special</i> curry...

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.110
Wh-What a smell...

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:31.350
Impressive...

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.030
Have a bite...

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:35.030
Ah! It spilled!

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.160
Oh, my! We can't have that.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:41.440
Let's make sure it
spills completely!

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:46.930
We change that much with
the X on us, wow...

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:47.730
But...

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:48.740
...it's kind of...

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:49.970
...fun!

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:50.940
Desu!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.240
Hey, let's stick it on
everyone else!

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.350
That'll be fun!

00:03:56.350 --> 00:04:00.280
Um, maybe I could put on an
X just for old times sake?

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:03.220
Naw, it's okay. We've seen
yours before, Dia.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.580
Oh! Kiseki's over there!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.910
Hey, Kiseki!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:12.180
Yeah... People have
seen it already...

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.940
See you again!

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.700
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:18.720
Character Transformations!

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.470
Today's Character Transformation is...

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.150
Platinum Royal!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:31.040
Platinum Royal is the form that Tadase takes
when he Character Transforms with Kiseki!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:36.510
His special attack releases energy
from his rod, Holy Crown!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.210
He's a cool looking Prince,
don't you think?

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.090
And the second Character
Transformation is...

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.350
Dear Baby!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:02.110
Dear Baby is the form that Yaya takes when
she Character Transforms with Pepe!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:07.390
Her special attack uses toy ducks to do
her bidding, Go! Go! Little Duckies!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.450
Her baby character
is really cute!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.240
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedia entries each week!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.390
Look forward to it!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.590
Shugo Chara Nail Art!

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.040
Let's design nail art using the Shugo
Chara as the inspiration!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.160
Today'll be Amulet Spade!

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:38.110
The theme is Prism Music!

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.320
I can't wait!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.760
It's about music, so first
we have a keyboard!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:46.040
A piano keyboard, cool!

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:49.750
Maybe I'll paint a stripe.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:54.060
Oh, you're good!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:58.210
And on top of that, a note!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.280
Ooh, great!

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.010
And then a G-clef!

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.720
Aw, how cute!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.260
And another big G-clef!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:15.600
There's a lot of special
music symbols!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.000
I'm done!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.040
Finished!

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:24.840
Nail art in the theme of Prism
Music! How pretty!

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.500
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.940
"Miki's Laboratory - Part 4"

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.080
I am the genius scientist who
can create anything!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.160
Professor Miki!

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:46.890
And her assi-

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:48.190
Hold it-dechu!

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:53.300
I am the genius scientist who
can create anything!

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:55.220
Professor Pepe!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.170
And her assistant, Kusukusu!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.760
And also her assistant Ran!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.060
And also her assistant Su!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.700
Welcome to my laboratory!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.960
Wait a second!

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.240
Professor Pepe, what
did you invent today?

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.310
I am glad that you asked.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:14.700
Today's invention is...

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.470
This-dechu!

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:21.880
It's a machine that'll transport you
from here to over there-dechu!

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:25.590
Start the experiment-dechu!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.780
Professor Pepe is using herself
as the test subject!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.380
Unlike a certain someone
we know.

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:32.220
Switch on!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.130
She disappeared!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:40.950
Wow!

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:42.730
It's a complete success!

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.900
Complete success my butt!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.180
She's multiplied!

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.910
All according to plan-dechu.

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:53.660
This machine also functions as
a duplication device-dechu.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.920
Next up is Kusukusu's
turn-dechu.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.320
Roger!

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:00.010
Wait! This is too dangerous!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.330
Switch on!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.750
Tada!

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.310
Huh? I didn't multiply.

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:12.940
A failure, huh? Thank goodness.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:15.250
But it was a lot of fun!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:20.810
I see... So Kusukusu will multiply
when she laughs.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:21.480
Wait...

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.310
Bala-balance!

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:26.550
Ack! Stop laughing!

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:27.350
This isn't good!

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:28.560
What are we to do?

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.450
In this case...

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.790
We should multiply as well!

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:56.750
See you again

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:00.490
Shugo Chara Nail Art!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.720
Let's design nail art using the Shugo
Chara as the inspiration!

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:07.040
Next'll be Amulet Diamond!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:10.180
Since I'm Diamond, I'll make it with
a sparkling image in mind!

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.070
Okay, do your best!

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.950
Let's put a big diamond
on the thumb!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.080
Can she put it on correctly?

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.260
Okay, it's a success!

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:24.580
Two stars on the pointer finger.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:32.360
Yeah, that's sparkling!

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.840
A big star on the ring finger...

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.720
The polka-dotted
star is cute, too.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.500
Lots of stars!

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:48.790
Ah, it's sparkling!

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:52.360
All done!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.130
Finished!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:58.090
Nail art in the theme of a
Diamond! Nice and cute!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:04.580
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:08.560
Today's episode is "Shock!
My Egg got an X on it?"

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.830
Rikka's egg is in trouble!

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:12.640
Coming right up!

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:27.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:31.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:41.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:47.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:52.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:57.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:05.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:11.290
I have something to say.

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:17.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:23.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:28.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:35.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:50.220
20 - Shock! My Egg
got an X on it?

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.830
Your Guardian Character
won't hatch?

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:55.460
It's been quite a while since the egg
was born, but it hasn't hatched yet.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:58.490
I wonder what I could
do to get it to hatch?

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:00.180
I told you, don't be
in such a rush.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:01.330
That's right!

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:04.010
Everyone hatches at
different times.

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:07.330
And when that time comes, you'll have yourself
an energetic Guardian Character.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:11.670
Yeah... But what if it
stays an egg forever?

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:14.290
Yup, it's got to be Hinamori-san!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.590
Seiyo Academy

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.590
Coolest Girl In School Ranking

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.590
#1 Hinamori Amu

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.860
This again?

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.970
Are you stupid or what?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.860
So cool!

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.710
She's so cool & spicy!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.880
Amu-senpai is so cool!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:41.340
Man, I wanna be like Amu-senpai!

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:43.500
Who I want to be, huh?

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:48.400
Maybe if I become more like Amu-senpai,
my Guardian Character will hatch...

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.530
That's it!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.960
Rikka-chan, isn't that...

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.050
Are you stupid or what?

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:03.970
We knew it! It's Amu-chan!

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.770
Rikka, what's going on?

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:09.120
I am becoming you, Amu-senpai!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:09.930
Huh?

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:10.900
Why?

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:13.440
'Cause you're just so
cool, Amu-senpai!

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.390
But, why...

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:18.150
That cape is <i>so</i>
not my style!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.120
Ahh, I said it!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.740
I said it just like Amu-senpai!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.150
What am I gonna do?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.150
U-Uh...

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.870
That was a pretty good
Amu she did there.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.310
Yeah, she's got your idiosyncrasies down.

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:31.640
Almost like a little Amu-chan...

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:34.070
Exactly! I'm Amu Jr.!

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:36.170
Amu Jr...?

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.930
Amu Jr.! Amu Jr.!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:44.720
Look, look!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.890
Rikka!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:52.250
Rikka, what's with that look?

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.960
What do you think?
Fits me, right?

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.740
It's kind of weird.

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.680
It's not cool?

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.520
It's not like you, Rikka.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:03.250
And it doesn't suit you at all.

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:06.060
It doesn't s-suit me?!

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:11.460
What's the matter with Rikka, pretending
to be me all of a sudden?

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:14.640
She said that she was going
to be you, or something.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.160
Why me?

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:20.230
Yes! If you're going to admire someone,
it should be I, the King!

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:23.190
Kiseki-san, please be quiet.

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:28.340
Perhaps Rikka-chan is worried about who she
wants to be and is trying to speed things up.

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:34.430
Yeah, actually she told me she was worried
about her Guardian Character not hatching.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:37.620
Everyone worries about it...

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.890
What is it I want to be?

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.690
It's something you can only
answer for yourself.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:50.160
But if Rikka's worried about something,
I want to help her if I can.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.200
Amu-chan...

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:56.000
Yeah...

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:06.130
How in the world can I become
like Amu-senpai?

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.170
Impossible, impossible!

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.890
Yeah, you're right. I've
never been cool.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:22.480
I can't do Open Heart, I'm short,
I lose stuff really easily.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.050
I can't keep my room clean...

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:29.500
That's why my Guardian Character
won't hatch...

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:36.950
I hate who I am...

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.260
N-No way!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:49.880
It turned into an X egg!

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:53.620
What am I gonna do?!

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.100
I'm screwed!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:58.960
Wait! I'll just get Amu-senpai
to purify it!

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:07.320
If Amu-senpai knew that
my egg got an X on it...

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:11.490
So you got an X on your egg?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.760
And I had such high hopes
for you, Rikka...

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.160
Amu-senpai will hate me...

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.180
No! I don't want that!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.380
But, what'll I do!

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:27.840
Amu-senpai will never
forgive me for this!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.790
Wait, the egg...

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.210
No way! Which one is it?

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:37.600
Which one is my egg?!

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:43.350
No... No way...

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:52.660
What am I gonna do?
I wasn't able to find it.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.700
It's over...

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:59.670
I can't go back there while
my egg has an X on it.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:02.960
Amu-senpai will hate me for sure!

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.090
Rikka!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.340
What are you doing here?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.050
Amu-senpai!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:12.920
Worried about something?

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:15.750
Amu-senpai will hate me...

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.110
I-It's nothing.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:24.310
I want to help you if you're worried
about something, Rikka.

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:29.390
I'll listen to you, Rikka.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.360
So, feel free to tell
me anything.

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:38.280
Amu-senpai...

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:43.550
If... Say, hypothetically,
my egg got an X on it...

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.920
You'd hate me, right
Amu-senpai?

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:49.130
Huh?

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:59.260
Y-You see...

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.130
That's not true.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:06.090
Actually I had an X on
one of my eggs, too.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.400
You did?

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:13.800
I'm not as cool or strong
as you think, Rikka.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:19.820
That's not true! You're totally
cool, and you're really nice!

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:26.970
Do you remember the
first time we met?

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.080
You were watering a flower.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:37.510
You were trying your best to carry water to
a flower growing next to a telephone pole.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:39.450
Yeah, now that you mention it.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.310
You're kind!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:43.200
That's not true...

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:47.600
And there was the time you climbed
a tree to save a kitten.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.360
And that's not all.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.010
You watered the flower beds...

00:18:57.010 --> 00:19:00.780
You took care of that sick
rabbit with Hikaru-kun...

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:06.660
You worried about what would happen to the heart's eggs
after they were purified, and chased after them...

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.840
Those are all things you did
because you're Rikka-chan.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.480
Yeah!

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:14.420
Because I'm Rikka?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:18.390
And I think you're cool like that, Rikka.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:20.260
Senpai...

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:24.410
Oh, and I have to thank you
for something, Rikka.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.640
Huh? Thank me?

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:31.350
Thanks to you, I was able to understand
what the X eggs are saying again.

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:36.330
And I remembered that I had
to listen carefully to them.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.530
Thank you, Rikka!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:41.240
Amu-senpai...

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:46.150
You have so many good
traits that I like.

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:50.580
So don't force yourself
to act like me, 'kay?

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.830
Rikka's Rikka, got it?

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:56.580
I am... me?

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:06.930
But it still doesn't tell
me who I want to be.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:14.560
If my egg has an X
on it forever...

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.590
Well, that's fine too!

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.940
Even if there's an X on it,
that's just who I am!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.210
Because I'm me, and that's that!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.130
And all of you are you, too!

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.200
I am pleased to meet you
for the first time.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:11.390
I am named Hotaru.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:19.820
And it pleasures me greatly
to do so at this time...

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:21.310
Huh?

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:26.780
Y-You're the me who
I want to be?

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.880
Yes.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:32.220
I hope we continue this fruitful relationship
for a lengthy period, Rikka-chan!

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:40.260
Alrighty! My Guardian
Character is born!

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:46.710
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:50.180
Choose one of the four eggs.

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.170
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:01.160
Guardian Egg Love Fortune Telling!

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:03.720
First, for those of you
who chose Dia's egg...

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:06.280
Four Shugoluck stars,
Super Lucky!

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:08.160
You couldn't be more popular!

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:10.790
You might be asked out by the
person you have a crush on!

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:11.090
Someone you least expect
might confess to you!

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:14.350
Su's egg is three
Shugoluck stars.

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:17.220
Someone will appear that'll
help you in love!

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:17.220
Tell them your feelings truthfully!

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:18.930
Miki's egg is two
Shugoluck stars.

00:22:18.930 --> 00:22:22.270
Do a favor for someone, and
they'll like you better!

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:24.630
Finally, for those of you
who chose Ran's egg...

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:28.090
Aw, snap! One Shugoluck star!

00:22:28.090 --> 00:22:32.150
You might be flustered in front of a crush
and say something you shouldn't!

00:22:28.090 --> 00:22:35.090
Lucky Item: Toothbrush.

00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:35.390
Stay calm and choose your
words carefully, okay?

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:40.220
Today sure was fun!

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:42.540
Stay tuned for the next
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:45.600
Lock on: Open Heart!

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:47.850
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
